{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tbl-tm-interactions-table3-data","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Table","doco:Table"],"label":"tbl:tm-interactions-table3-data","kind":"table","title":"Table 3 from tm-interactions","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tm-interactions"],"tags":["extracted-table"],"text":"tm-interactions-table3-data.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"tbl:tm-interactions-table3-data\"></a><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Process</th>\n<th><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Delta</code> operator</th>\n<th>Explicit matrix</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\beta^-</code> decay (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{d} \\to \\mathfrak{u}</code>)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Delta_\\beta</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\frac{q - q^{-1}}{2}\\mathbb{I}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\beta^+</code> decay (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{u} \\to \\mathfrak{d}</code>)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-\\Delta_\\beta</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-\\frac{q - q^{-1}}{2}\\mathbb{I}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Photon absorption</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{pp}</code> (appended)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\begin{pmatrix} q-q^{-1} &#x26; 1 \\\\ 1 &#x26; 0 \\end{pmatrix}</code> (new factor)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Photon emission</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{pp}^{-1}</code> (removed)</td>\n<td>Remove one factor from chain</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pair creation <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\gamma\\gamma \\to e^- e^+</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-\\Delta_\\beta</code></td>\n<td>Same as <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\beta^+</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pair annihilation <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">e^- e^+ \\to \\gamma\\gamma</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Delta_\\beta</code></td>\n<td>Same as <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\beta^-</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">2\\beta</code> (quadratic term)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Delta_\\beta \\cdot C \\cdot \\Delta_\\beta</code></td>\n<td>Depends on intervening matrices <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">C</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-transfer-matrices/tm-interactions-table3-data.md","heading":"Table"}
